resources.string:
The vehicle status does not meet the upgrade conditions and cannot be upgraded. Please confirm that all the following conditions are met before upgrading.
1.The gear has been switched to Gear P;
2.The SOC is greater than %d%%;
3.The engine hood has been closed.

In the process of upgrading, the vehicle won’t move. Except for the vehicle locking/unlocking, interior lamps, hazard warning lights, and window opening and closing functions, all other functions of the vehicle will be temporarily disabled. Before upgrading, please ensure that:
1.The gear has been switched to Gear P;
2.The remaining power is greater than %d%%;
3.The engine hood has been closed.

Upgrade package is detected, but the vehicle status does not meet the upgrade conditions, so the upgrade cannot be started. Please confirm that the following conditions are met before upgrade: 
 1. The current vehicle speed is 0;
 2. The vehicle is in the P gear;
 3. The SOC is ＞15%;
 4. The parking brake or EPB is applied.
